          "description": "Trigger A living creature enters the area\nEffect A 60-foot-tall metal spire rises from the ground, puncturing the triggering creature and dealing 4d10+26 piercing damage (check (reflex, dc:32, basic) save). On a critical failure, the creature is additionally impaled, becoming Grabbed until it Escape DC 30. A creature that Escapes is 60 feet in the air. Additionally, all creatures within 10-feet of the spire take 2d10+13 bludgeoning damage (check (reflex, dc:32, basic) save). On a failure, they're knocked Prone.",
