      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(3 actions) The trap uses its first action to move directly toward the nearest living creature, its second action to make a door Strike against each adjacent creature, and its third action to Batter. This trap doesn't take a multiple attack penalty.\nSpeed 15 feet",
