      "disable": "check (arcana, dc:32) or check (occultism, dc:32) (expert) to banish one of the three the shadow tendrils or check (thievery, dc:34) (master) twice to confound the bowl's magical sensors\nBypass A creature who places an offering worth at least 10 gp into the bowl doesn't trigger the trap and isn't targeted by the trap.",
