      "stealth": {
        "modifier": -10,
        "details": ""
      },
      "disable": "check (nature, dc:30) or check (survival, dc:30) (expert) to douse flames or check (athletics, dc:32) (expert) to smother flames; on the sixth successful check, the flames go out. Casting a non-cantrip water spell on the flames counts as one success.",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(1 action; fire) On its turn, the fire deals 2d8+13 fire damage to creatures in the grove, plus an additional 6 fire damage to Corazal and any creature within 15 feet of them (check (reflex, dc:29, basic) save).",
      "reset": "",
      "saves": {
        "fortitude": 0,
        "reflex": 0,
        "will": 0
      },
