          "name": "Explosive End",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When Unaasi dies, the planar portal inside them collapses, causing them to explode in a burst of scouring energy that deals 11d6 fire damage to all creatures in their luminant aura (check (reflex, dc:32, basic, options:area-effect) save). Their body is completely consumed, leaving behind only their gear.",
