          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The ghost laments its fate, forcing each living creature within 30-foot emanation to attempt a check (will, dc:33, options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened) save. On a failure, a creature becomes Frightened 2 (or Frightened 3 on a critical failure). On a success, a creature is temporarily immune to this ghost's frightful moan for 1 minute.",
