          "name": "Invigorating Flense",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nEffect The mask makes a quick striking motion, as if slicing flesh with a small knife, and targets a creature within 30 feet. The target immediately takes 12d6 slashing damage] damage (check (fortitude, dc:37, basic) save), and the mask becomes Quickened as long as the target continues to take persistent bleed damage. The mask can use the extra action only to Stride or Strike",
