          "name": "Create Poison",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nEffect Venomfist transforms a portion of their watery body into a single dose of any type of common poison of 20th level or lower—tears of death is their favorite. If they're holding a container, they can create the poison within that container, at which point the poison remains viable for 24 hours before it reverts to water. Alternatively, they can apply a contact or injury-created poison to their fist.",
