          "name": "Unexplained Demise",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Trigger Delvarnis is captured alive\nEffect Blood pours from Delvarnis' ears and nose, and they drop dead on the spot. An adjacent PC who witnesses this unexplained death must succeed at a check (will, dc:27) save or become Frightened 1.",
