          "id": "qcy89Ztl9BMxwhem",
          "name": "Putrid Plague",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The sickened and unconscious conditions from putrid plague can't end or be reduced until the disease is cured\nSaving Throw check (fortitude, dc:36)\nStage 1 carrier with no ill effect (1d4 hours),\nStage 2 Sickened 1 (1 day),\nStage 3 sickened 1 and Slowed 1 (1 day),\nStage 4 Unconscious (1 day),\nStage 5 dead",
