          "name": "Battle Roar",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per minute\nEffect The vansidieth attempts to Demoralize all foes within 30 feet (rolling one attempt against all enemies' Will DCs). If the vansidieth critically succeeds against at least one enemy, the demon becomes Quickened for 1 round on their next turn and can use the extra action each round to Demoralize or Feint.",
