          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "An imvath's fangs rip and tear souls as easily as they do flesh and bone. The first time in a round that a creature takes any spirit damage from an imvath's bite, it must succeed at a check (will, dc:41) save or its doomed condition value increases by 1.",
