          "description": "The shadow scamp creates a blast of clinging shadows in a 15-foot type:cone that deal 2d4 void damage to each creature within the area (check (reflex, dc:16, basic, options:area-effect,inflicts:dazzled) save). A creature that fails its save is also Dazzled for 1 round. The shadow scamp can't use Shade Breath again for 1d4.",
