          "name": "Breath Control",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Inizkar can hold her breath for 25 times as long before suffocating. She gains a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against inhaled threats, such as inhaled poisons, and if she rolls a success on such a saving throw, she get a critical success instead.",
          "traits": []
