          "id": "p9glL4qO0pjsLrc7",
          "name": "Siphon Vitality",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The blood ooze draws forth blood from nearby creatures, causing their flesh to break open and blood to spill out, which replenishes the blood ooze. Each living creature within 15-foot emanation takes 4d6 slashing damage (check (fortitude, dc:24, basic, options:area-effect) save). The blood ooze regains an amount of Hit Points equal to half the damage Siphon Vitality dealt to the single creature that took the most damage.",
