          "id": "bU4iO3oL4EOAnlGK",
          "name": "Construct Armor",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Like normal objects, an animated treasure swarm has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage the swarm takes by an amount equal to its Hardness. Once an animated treasure swarm is reduced to fewer than half its Hit Points, or immediately upon becoming damaged by a critical hit, its construct armor breaks, removing the Hardness and reducing its AC to 21.",
