      "disable": "check (thievery, dc:28) (expert) to scratch out the magical symbols, check (arcana, dc:28) (expert) to safely siphon the magical energy, or Dispel Magic (4th rank; counteract DC 26)\nBypass Anyone other than Mirida turns the door handle three times to the right and once to the left in quick succession.",
