          "name": "Debilitating Pain",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature tries to unlock or Pick the Lock\nEffect The trap deals the triggering creature 2d10+11 mental damage (nonlethal) (check (will, dc:30, basic) save) and 1d6 persistent mental damage (nonlethal). A creature that fails their save is additionally Paralyzed for as long as they suffer the persistent mental damage.",
          "traits": []
