          "name": "Retaliatory Flare",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger Tokainen would be damage by an adjacent creature\nEffect Tokainen's flesh flares with scouring flames, dealing 1d4 fire damage to all adjacent enemies (check (reflex, dc:28, basic) save; increased to 2d8 fire damage if Tokainen is using Channel the Cataclysm stance).",
