          "name": "Spiral Swing",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements Tokainen is wielding her meteor hammer and is in Channel Cataclysm stance\nEffect Tokainen swings her meteor hammer in a wide circle, dealing 4d8 bludgeoning damage damage to each enemy in a 10-foot emanation. Tokainen can't use Spiral Swing again for 1d4.",
