          "description": "Trigger A creature steps on the floor or places pressure on the walls or ceiling of these two adjoining halls\nEffect Silver blades erupt from the walls and wildly slash everything in the area, dealing 2d10+13 slashing damage (magic, silver) to all creatures in the area (check (reflex, dc:30, basic) save). The trap then rolls initiative.",
