          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "20 feet. The terns' awful racket of screeches and howls drowns out other sounds. Any creature performing an auditory action in the area must yell over the din, requiring a successful check (fortitude, dc:15) save or check (performance, dc:15) check to project loudly enough; on a failure, the action is lost.",
