          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nTrigger Akki takes piercing or slashing damage\nEffect Akki's blood sprays from the wound, forming a crimson cloud laced with tiny lightning bolts. Adjacent creatures take 1 splash)[electricity damage] damage, and Akki is Concealed until the end of her next turn.",
